    "difficultyReason": "The hardest part asks students to choose a pairing of four terms and create a common binomial, including taking out a negative factor, then combine it with repeated difference-of-squares factorisation. The stem and first two parts explicitly teach and rehearse the pairing pattern, so the independent reframing is supported, but c still links several nontrivial decisions.",
